              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Function 'time_it' accepts higher-order strategy parameter 'f' for dynamic algorithm injection"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "behavioral"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-LAZY_MEMOIZATION",
              "name": "lazy_memoization",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Lazy Memoization"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Module 'Test_bytecode_crypto' integrates Lazy Memoization pattern for deferred on-demand computation and caching"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "structural"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-RECORD_FUNCTION_VTABLE",
              "name": "record_function_vtable",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Record Function Vtable"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Record type 'sink' in 'Logger' implements explicit VTable Virtual Method Table containing 2 function method(s)"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "structural"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-DOMAINS_PARALLELISM",
              "name": "domains_parallelism",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Domains Parallelism"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Module 'Domain_pool' leverages OCaml 5 Multicore Domains parallelism for shared-memory parallel thread execution"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "effect_concurrency"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-UNCHECKED_EXCEPTION_RAISE",
              "name": "unchecked_exception_raise",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Unchecked Exception Raise"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Type Safety Audit: Function 'sample_func' in 'Profiling' throws unhandled runtime exception (`failwith`/`raise`); return typed `Result.t` or `Option.t` instead"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "type_safety"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-DEFENSIVE_CATCH_ALL_EXN",
              "name": "defensive_catch_all_exn",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Defensive Catch All Exn"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resilience Smell (Defensive Catch-All): Function 'format_loc' in 'Logger' swallows all exceptions (`with _ -> ...`); catch specific expected exceptions only"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "resilience"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-MUTABLE_REF_OVERUSE",
              "name": "mutable_ref_overuse",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Mutable Ref Overuse"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Functional Purity Audit: Module 'C_trampoline_adapter' defines 15 mutable references / fields, breaking immutability; favor pure recursive accumulators"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "principle"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-PHYSICAL_EQUALITY_SMELL",
              "name": "physical_equality_smell",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Physical Equality Smell"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Type Safety Hazard (Physical Equality): Function 's_while' in 'Test_cpp_codegen' uses physical pointer equality (`==` / `!=`); use structural value equality (`=` / `<>`) to avoid subtle value comparison bugs"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "type_safety"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-GOD_MODULE_SRP",
              "name": "god_module_srp",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: God Module Srp"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SRP Violation (God Module): Module 'C_trampoline_adapter' defines 135 functions across 725 lines of code, indicating multiple mixed domain responsibilities"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "principle"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-CYCLOMATIC_COMPLEXITY_KISS",
              "name": "cyclomatic_complexity_kiss",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Cyclomatic Complexity Kiss"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "KISS Violation (High Complexity): Function 'loop' in 'C_trampoline_adapter' has cyclomatic complexity of 13; decompose nested pattern matches into helper functions"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "principle"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DPX-OCAML-DUPLICATE_CODE_DRY",
              "name": "duplicate_code_dry",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OCaml Pattern: Duplicate Code Dry"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "DRY Violation: Identical function logic duplicated across 4 location(s): C_trampoline_adapter.found, Test_native_semantics.found, Test_c_macro_obf.found"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "principle"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
